sequenceDiagram
  participant SensorManager
  participant DataSource
  participant SensorVM
  participant MlVM
  participant TFLite
  SensorManager->>DataSource: SensorEvent(x,y,z,t)
  DataSource->>SensorVM: SensorSample
  SensorVM-->>MlVM: ordered SharedFlow sample
  MlVM->>MlVM: validate timestamp and append to bounded 20x3 window
  MlVM->>MlVM: discard non-monotonic or gap over 100 ms
  MlVM->>TFLite: float[1,20,3]
  TFLite-->>MlVM: probabilities[REST,RESTLESS,ACTIVE]
